firefox-addons:2936785.description:
After installation, open or refresh a pixiv.net page. This tool will show a blue button on the right side of the page. Click it to start using it.
If you want to download all works from a user, you can click the "Start crawl" button on that user's profile page.
Features:
- Batch download all works from an artist, your bookmarks, your following list, rankings, search results, and more;
- One-click download any work you see;
- Manually select the works you want to download on the page;
- Set filtering criteria to choose the works you want to download;
- Download illustrations, manga, Ugoira, and novels;
- Save Ugoira as GIF, WebM, WebP, APNG, or ZIP;
- Save novels as TXT or EPUB;
- Create folders using artist names, dates, titles, and other data;
- Customize file names and sort them;
- Add leading zeros to numbers so sorting stays correct;
- Save user avatars and cover images;
- Show larger thumbnails for easier viewing;
- Preview large images on thumbnails and view original images;
- Save download records to avoid duplicate downloads;
- Save download progress and resume unfinished downloads;
- Export work data;
- Batch bookmark works;
- Improve your experience when managing bookmarks;
- Scheduled crawling;
- Highlight followed users;
GitHub： https://github.com/xuejianxianzun/PixivBatchDownloader

